&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20131017091621im_/http:/typophile.com/files/Florish_4009.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Finial</title><link>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/40403/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Dec 2007 15:15:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/40403/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015204914/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Indices"&gt;Indices&lt;/a&gt; : &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015204914/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Terminology"&gt;Terminology&lt;/a&gt; : &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131015204914/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Terminal"&gt;Terminal&lt;/a&gt; : Finial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
